===Noun===
{{en-noun|figures of speech}}

# {{lb|en|rhetoric|stylistic}} A word or phrase that intentionally deviates from ordinary language use to produce a rhetorical effect.
#: {{hyponyms|en|Thesaurus:figure of speech}}
# {{lb|en|loosely}} A [[turn of phrase]] that ought not to be taken literally, but rather as employed for convenience of expression only.
#: {{syn|en|façon de parler}}
#: {{coi|en|I hope you didn't take it the wrong way, that was a '''figure of speech'''.}}

